BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Shut Up & Write Western NC
UID:event_313195019@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260421T141748Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T193000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® - Downtown
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Western North Carolina\nShut Up & Write!\n\
 n**Here's how it works.** Show up at or before 6:00. At 6:00\, we do some 
 quick introductions. Afterward\, for a full 60 minutes (I'll set a timer!)
  we are heads-down writing. Writing what? A novel? You bet. Some poetry? S
 ure. Song lyrics? Your resume? That report you need to get to your boss be
 fore 8 AM or you'll *need* *to write* that resume? All of the above and mo
 re. Just shut up and write.\n\nSurrounding ourselves with other writers wh
 o are busy putting words onto page (physical or virtual) keeps us all acco
 untable and focused.\n\nWhen the timer goes off\, we'll check-in with each
  other and see how it went. Afterward\, feel free to stay to chat and get 
 to know your fellow writers\, or keep writing\, or take off.\n\nSocializin
 g is optional and will happen after (or briefly before) the focused writin
 g. This is a safe space to work on your craft. No one will read or critiqu
 e your writing.\n\nFor more information about our events\, visit [https://
 shutupwrite.com](https://shutupwrite.com).\n\n**What to Expect**\n\n* Roug
 hly 15 minutes of introductions\n* 60 minutes of focused writing (somebody
  set a timer)!\n* Afterward\, optional socializing\n\n**Being late is okay
 :** Just show up and get settled\, then check in with the host after the s
 ession. (Look for the person with the Shut Up & Write sign).\n\n**What Sho
 uld I Bring?**\n\n* Whatever you need to be able to write!\n* Earbuds/earp
 lugs if you want to block ambient noise.\n\n**Other Important Details:**\n
 \nHOSTS: This is a multi-host event\, so most of the time there will be a 
 host present. If we are unlucky and no host can attend\, please find each 
 other and self-organize. Pay attention to the event chat and comments to s
 ee who is available.\n\nWI-FI: Yes!\n\nPARKING: Street parking in metered 
 spots is free after 6pm. Closest municipal garages ($2/hour) are Wall St. 
 & Coxe Street/Sears Alley.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwriteasheville/events/313195
 019/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260203T221145Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260203T221145Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Shut Up & Write Western NC
UID:event_313768996@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260421T141748Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260426T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260426T120000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write - South Asheville 
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Western North Carolina\nCoworking for write
 rs in your area!\nJoin us for some focused writing time. All writers and a
 ll experience levels are welcome and don’t worry\, no one will see what 
 you've written. This session is about getting your writing done and meetin
 g other writers in your area.\n\nPlease arrive a few minutes early to say 
 hello to everyone\, grab a drink\, and get your writing tools ready. Once 
 everyone’s arrived\, I will lead quick introductions and then set the ti
 mer for our quiet and focused writing session.\n\nAfterward\, we’ll have
  time to chat and get to know each other. We often talk about our successe
 s and challenges as writers. If you don’t have time to stick around\, no
  worries!\n\nA note about the format\nWe don’t host critiques or reading
 s. These events are a safe space for writers of all skill levels and genre
 s to work on their craft\, so no one will read or critique your writing.\n
 \nFor our full event schedule\, visit https://shutupwrite.com\n\nOther Imp
 ortant Details:\n\nVenue Guidelines: Please thank our hosts by purchasing 
 something.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwriteasheville/events/313768
 996/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260313T160455Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260313T160455Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Shut Up & Write Western NC
UID:event_314167359@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260421T141748Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260427T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260427T153000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® in Candler/West Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Western North Carolina\nPlease join me and 
 other local writers for a group writing session. Bring whatever you're wor
 king on and grab a coffee\, and we will write alongside each other.\n\nThi
 s is not a critique group\, but we do have short social periods before and
  after writing.\n\\-\\-\\-\nMany have mentioned that The Dripolator is a l
 ittle hard to find if you've never been before. The coffeeshop is located 
 in a strip mall where the Candler YMCA is\, and the sonic. The Dripolator 
 is next to the bank\, and looks a little like a house. There is usually pl
 enty of parking in the lot out front. If you're having trouble send me a m
 essage!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwriteasheville/events/314167
 359/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260407T180941Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260407T180941Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
